To integrate the new logo (nested triangle with a star) while preserving the site's design system, I will update `components/Layout.tsx`.

I will replace the existing "C" monogram with a custom SVG representing the new geometric logo. I will also align the typography of the brand name in the header and footer to match the sans-serif style shown in the provided logo image, while keeping the rest of the site's typography consistent.

The logo will be implemented as an SVG with:
1.  **Outer Triangle**: Thick stroke.
2.  **Inner Triangle**: Thick stroke.
3.  **Central Star**: Gold/Beige fill (`#D4AF37` or using the site's `sb-beige`).

# Updated files:

## components/Layout.tsx

-   Replaced the HTML/CSS circle logo with a custom SVG `LogoIcon` component.
-   The SVG features the double triangle and the central star (colored in beige/gold).
-   Updated the "CABINET DELACOUR" text in the navigation and footer to use `font-sans` (Inter) to match the visual identity of the provided logo image, while keeping the spacing and weight premium.
-   Refined the footer brand section to use the new logo.

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { NAV_ITEMS } from '../constants';
import { Page } from '../types';
import { Menu, X } from 'lucide-react';

interface LayoutProps {
  children: React.ReactNode;
  currentPage: Page;
  onNavigate: (page: Page) => void;
}

// Custom SVG Logo Component to match the provided image
const LogoIcon: React.FC<{ className?: string, starClassName?: string }> = ({ className = "text-current", starClassName = "text-sb-beige" }) => (
  <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="6" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" className={className}>
    {/* Outer Triangle */}
    <path d="M50 15 L85 80 L15 80 Z" />
    {/* Inner Triangle */}
    <path d="M50 35 L70 70 L30 70 Z" strokeWidth="5" />
    {/* Star - North Star Style */}
    <path 
        d="M50 48 L53 58 L62 60 L53 62 L50 72 L47 62 L38 60 L47 58 Z" 
        fill="currentColor" 
        stroke="none" 
        className={starClassName}
    />
  </svg>
);

const Layout: React.FC<LayoutProps> = ({ children, currentPage, onNavigate }) => {
  const [isScrolled, setIsScrolled] = useState(false);
  const [isMobileMenuOpen, setIsMobileMenuOpen] = useState(false);

  // Pages that start with a dark green background
  const hasDarkHero = [Page.HOME, Page.SERVICES, Page.CONTACT, Page.LEGAL].includes(currentPage);

  // Determine if we should use white text/elements based on scroll OR dark background
  const useWhiteText = isScrolled || hasDarkHero;

  useEffect(() => {
    const handleScroll = () => {
      setIsScrolled(window.scrollY > 50);
    };
    window.addEventListener('scroll', handleScroll);
    return () => window.removeEventListener('scroll', handleScroll);
  }, []);

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-sb-cream font-sans text-sb-black selection:bg-sb-green-light selection:text-white">
      {/* Navigation */}
      <nav
        className={`fixed w-full z-50 transition-all duration-500 ${
          isScrolled ? 'bg-sb-green-dark/95 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg py-3' : 'bg-transparent py-6'
        }`}
      >
        <div className="container mx-auto px-6 flex justify-between items-center">
          {/* Logo */}
          <button 
            onClick={() => onNavigate(Page.HOME)} 
            className="flex items-center space-x-3 group focus:outline-none"
          >
            <div className={`w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 transform group-hover:scale-105`}>
               <LogoIcon 
                  className={`w-full h-full ${useWhiteText ? 'text-white' : 'text-sb-green-dark'}`} 
                  starClassName={useWhiteText ? 'text-sb-beige' : 'text-sb-green-dark'} // Star logic: Gold on dark, Green on light (or keep Gold? Let's keep Gold for contrast if bg is white, but on white bg gold might be hard to see? Actually Logo in image is black. Let's use Green lines and Gold star on light bg.)
               />
            </div>
            <div className="flex flex-col items-start">
                 <span className={`font-sans text-lg tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-bold transition-colors leading-none ${useWhiteText ? 'text-white' : 'text-sb-green-dark'}`}>Cabinet</span>
                 <span className={`font-sans text-lg tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-bold transition-colors leading-none ${useWhiteText ? 'text-white' : 'text-sb-green-dark'}`}>Delacour</span>
            </div>
          </button>

          {/* Desktop Menu */}
          <div className={`hidden md:flex p-1.5 rounded-full ${
              isScrolled 
                ? '' 
                : hasDarkHero 
                    ? 'bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm' 
                    : 'bg-sb-green-dark/5 backdrop-blur-sm'
          }`}>
            {NAV_ITEMS.map((item) => {
                const isActive = currentPage === item.page;
                // Determine active button style based on context
                let activeClass = '';
                if (isActive) {
                    if (hasDarkHero && !isScrolled) {
                        activeClass = 'bg-white text-sb-green-dark shadow-md';
                    } else {
                        activeClass = 'bg-sb-green-dark text-white shadow-md';
                    }
                }

                // Determine inactive button style
                let inactiveClass = '';
                if (useWhiteText) {
                    inactiveClass = 'text-white hover:bg-white/10';
                } else {
                    inactiveClass = 'text-sb-green-dark hover:bg-sb-green-dark/5';
                }

                return (
                    <button
                        key={item.page}
                        onClick={() => onNavigate(item.page)}
                        className={`px-6 py-2 rounded-full text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-300 ${
                        isActive ? activeClass : inactiveClass
                        }`}
                    >
                        {item.label}
                    </button>
                );
            })}
          </div>

          {/* Mobile Toggle */}
          <button 
            className={`md:hidden transition-colors ${useWhiteText ? 'text-white' : 'text-sb-green-dark'}`}
            onClick={() => setIsMobileMenuOpen(!isMobileMenuOpen)}
          >
            {isMobileMenuOpen ? <X size={32} /> : <Menu size={32} />}
          </button>
        </div>
      </nav>

      {/* Mobile Menu - Moved outside nav to prevent context clipping */}
      {isMobileMenuOpen && (
          <div className="md:hidden bg-sb-green-dark fixed inset-0 z-[60] flex flex-col justify-center items-center space-y-8">
            <button onClick={() => setIsMobileMenuOpen(false)} className="absolute top-6 right-6 text-white z-[70]">
                <X size={32} />
            </button>
            {NAV_ITEMS.map((item) => (
              <button
                key={item.page}
                onClick={() => {
                  onNavigate(item.page);
                  setIsMobileMenuOpen(false);
                }}
                className="text-3xl font-serif text-white hover:text-sb-beige transition-colors"
              >
                {item.label}
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        )}

      {/* Main Content */}
      <main className="flex-grow">
        {children}
      </main>

      {/* Footer */}
      <footer className="bg-sb-green-dark text-sb-cream py-20 mt-auto">
        <div className="container mx-auto px-6">
            <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 border-b border-sb-green-light/10 pb-12">
            <div className="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 space-y-6">
                <div className="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4">
                    <div className="w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center">
                        <LogoIcon className="text-white w-full h-full" starClassName="text-sb-beige" />
                    </div>
                    <div>
                         <h3 className="font-sans text-2xl font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase leading-none">Cabinet</h3>
                         <h3 className="font-sans text-2xl font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase leading-none">Delacour</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p className="text-sb-green-light max-w-md leading-relaxed font-light text-lg">
                Stratégie & Performance QHSE.<br/>
                Des interventions à forte valeur ajoutée pour renforcer la performance de votre organisation.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 className="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 text-xs text-sb-beige">Navigation</h4>
                <ul className="space-y-4 text-sb-green-light">
                {NAV_ITEMS.map(item => (
                    <li key={item.page}>
                    <button onClick={() => onNavigate(item.page)} className="hover:text-white transition-colors hover:translate-x-1 transform duration-300 inline-block">
                        {item.label}
                    </button>
                    </li>
                ))}
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 className="font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-8 text-xs text-sb-beige">Contact</h4>
                <ul className="space-y-4 text-sb-green-light font-light">
                <li>Paris, France</li>
                <li>contact@cabinet-delacour.fr</li>
                <li>+33 1 23 45 67 89</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            </div>

            <div className="pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center text-xs text-sb-green-light/40 font-light">
                <p>© 2024 Cabinet Delacour. Tous droits réservés.</p>
                <div className="mt-4 md:mt-0">
                    <button 
                        onClick={() => onNavigate(Page.LEGAL)} 
                        className="hover:text-sb-beige transition-colors underline decoration-transparent hover:decoration-sb-beige underline-offset-4"
                    >
                        Mentions Légales & Politique de Confidentialité
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  );
};

export default Layout;
```

